{"id":"f296fc34ba0d5288","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-laver.md","title":"Laver Forcing","display":"df-laver — Laver Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-laver","aliases":["58-df-laver"],"display":"df-laver — Laver Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-laver"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-laver</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-laver — Laver Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in V\">\\(S,T\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (有限自然数序列树参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{stem}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{stem}(T)\\)</span> (stem)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}\\)</span> (直接后继集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb L\">\\(\\mathbb L\\)</span> (本文件定义的 Laver forcing)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver}\\vdash\n\\mathbb L\\coloneqq\\left\\{T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subsetneq s\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\aleph_0)\\bigr]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver}\\vdash\n\\mathbb L\\coloneqq\\left\\{T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subsetneq s\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\aleph_0)\\bigr]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}order}\\vdash\nS\\leq_{\\mathbb L}T\\leftrightarrow S,T\\in\\mathbb L\\land S\\subseteq T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}order}\\vdash\nS\\leq_{\\mathbb L}T\\leftrightarrow S,T\\in\\mathbb L\\land S\\subseteq T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Laver forcing adds a dominating real.</li>\n<li>“树”在 assertion 中直接展开为对有限初始段封闭；书内一般树谓词是二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\)</span>，不能以未定义的一元形式调用。</li>\n<li>次序为反向包含（更小的树给出更强条件）。Laver forcing 是 proper 且加一个 dominating real，但不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{stem}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver}\\vdash\n\\mathbb L\\coloneqq\\left\\{T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\varnothing\\in T\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\subsetneq s\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\aleph_0)\\bigr]\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}order}\\vdash\nS\\leq_{\\mathbb L}T\\leftrightarrow S,T\\in\\mathbb L\\land S\\subseteq T","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"d05bde9d5231d251","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb L$ 与 $\\leq_{\\mathbb L}$ 是 Laver forcing 及其次序（见 [[../batch06/58-df-laver.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-764","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-laver.md|58-df-laver]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["c5203cd487b6ba6d"]}